# Name: Tiered Fractal Tree
# Summary: Repeated side forks build a compact symmetric crown with level-varying stroke widths.
# Visualizer: turtle_2d
# Angle: 45
# Iterations: 4
# Max Iterations: 4
# Initial Color: 6

# Render Map: A=F F=F

# ID       : LSYS-D251FEEC2804
