# JKUBIN | ___DESCR(⟦An ordinary fractal tree of various thicknesses of branches⟧)
# JKUBIN | ___USAGE(⟦m4 lsys.m4 tree_thickness.ls | turtle_plotter⟧)
# JKUBIN | 
# JKUBIN | AXIOM(⟦TREE⟧, ⟦A⟧)
# JKUBIN | RULE(⟦A⟧, ⟦F[+A][-A]FA⟧, ⟦F⟧)
# JKUBIN | RULE(⟦F⟧, ⟦#FF!⟧, ⟦F⟧)
# JKUBIN | 
# JKUBIN | divert⟦⟧dnl turtle configuration
# JKUBIN | ANGLE(45),dnl
# JKUBIN | "step":4,dnl
# JKUBIN | "sety":-530,dnl
# JKUBIN | "seth":90,dnl
# JKUBIN | 
# JKUBIN | TREE(7)
